    "status": "present",
    "value": "Parse each payment by splitting at the first two commas (the memo may contain commas). The memo references an invoice through the first occurrence of \"paying off:\" immediately followed by an id made of [A-Za-z0-9_-]. Return, per payment in input order, [paymentId, invoiceId] when the referenced invoice exists, otherwise [paymentId, null]. Invoices may be referenced by several payments. Amounts are integers (minor units)."
  },
